  "explanation": "<!--版权声明：试题（含题干、答案、解析）由学科网授权提供，受版权保护--><div class=\"qml-explanation\" data-copyright=\"xkw.com-1791858264-114651791852237200-TTi4TkGsLyfHOy7-9p5CxNm8c4Nc2BmI4wkHJsjwgXpA1L4n7KpDa9J2LZXx64n-\"><div class=\"qml-seg\" seg-name=\"分析\">【分析】<p style=\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">根据等差数列通项公式求出公差，再结合求和公式求解即可</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">.</span></p></div><div class=\"qml-seg\" seg-name=\"详解\">【详解】<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">由等差数列通项公式</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/e7c3dabcbcf5dbed29cbf18e3130f44a.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">代入</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/f584f736afa95f4265e1c893958a5d98.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">可得</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/429acf202801cdd46bac5524d7ae45e6.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，解得</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/c5c1344592c925b273f2cb9b9e47ebbb.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">因为</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/e2bcd524b14735d9ddd98950a0b3a377.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，所以</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/d2d233a6280b893b5b8655df5209920a.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">故</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/a34792c7ff4c4a9a8deb980c2d06ff52.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">.</span></p></div></div>",
